From 331c365518017db8839145494f63a9202c4851e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:37:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: Union Room + comm stack: seed the real asm through the
 translator, drop Missing traps

Seeds the 71 Missing() comm/Union Room entry points and the 61 names hand-ported in ss3ds_union.c (chunks A-D) so the
maploader translator emits the real Thumb code (unk_02032844..0203A3B0, unk_02058AEC, unk_0205A44C closure). Drops the 71
remaining Missing() lines for them from missing.c.
---
 .../nitromain-perf/missing.c                  |  71 ----------
 .../maploader/seeds.json                      | 134 +++++++++++++++++-
 scripts/ss3ds_game.sh                         |  11 ++
 3 files changed, 144 insertions(+), 72 deletions(-)

